About this file
---------------

This directory uses pinned reference packages as interoperability oracles.
Historical receipts state whether a run used only public APIs and observed
wire output. Those historical evidence boundaries remain unchanged.

The owner permits source review. The first limited RNS source review was
reported on September 26; through October 4 no RNS implementation code was
copied or translated. From October 5, retinue and outrider are themselves
under the Reticulum License, and the reference implementations may be adapted
into them. Each crate's NOTICE lists adaptations. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
and design_docs/2026-10-05_reticulum_license_adoption.md at the repository
root.

The upstream license below is retained unmodified for this oracle's reference
package. The root RETICULUM_LICENSE contains the RNS license; this copy retains
its own package's copyright notice.

